@startuml

title Weather Station System State Diagram

[*] --> Running as InitialState

state Running <<running>>
state ConfigMode <<configuration>>
state SummaryPrep <<preparation>>
state StatusCheck <<check>>
state ControlledMode <<controlled>>

Running : entry / Start running
Running : do / Collect data by clock trigger
Running : exit / Data collected

ConfigMode : entry / Enter configuration mode
ConfigMode : do / Make necessary changes or settings
ConfigMode : exit / Configuration completed, return to Running

SummaryPrep : entry / Prepare weather summary
SummaryPrep : do / Generate and send out the summary
SummaryPrep : exit / Summary sent, return to Running

StatusCheck : entry / Check system status
StatusCheck : do / Transmit the result
StatusCheck : exit / Status checked, return to Running

ControlledMode : entry / Enter controlled mode
ControlledMode : do / Perform controlled operations
ControlledMode : exit / Controlled operation completed, return to Running

Running --> ConfigMode : request configuration
ConfigMode --> Running : config complete

Running --> SummaryPrep : request summary preparation
SummaryPrep --> Running : summary sent

Running --> StatusCheck : request status check
StatusCheck --> Running : status checked

Running --> ControlledMode : remote control command
ControlledMode --> Running : controlled operation completed

Running --> [*] : shutdown command
[*] --> Running : restart from shut down

@enduml
